From 48a2953afd8428e3292009a141b711582326a47d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Romario Kavin <98270892+RomarioKavin1@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 03:46:11 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(executor): ERC-8421 BUDGET-010 per-entity
 verification gas budgets

Replaces the flat MAX_VERIFY_GAS (100k, applied to the whole prefix before any stake
lookup) with per-entity budgets: each entity's limits.execution over its own validation
frames (pre_verify counts toward the approving frame's entity; the signature cost toward
tx.sender; expiry_verify toward no entity) must stay within maxVerifyGasPerEntity, or
maxVerifyGasStakedEntity when the Staking Registry reports the entity staked
(ReputationService.checkStake) and it is not a default-code account. New explorer rule
BUDGET-010, evaluated after structure and before simulation. The prefix-wide
MAX_VERIFY_STATE_GAS check is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
